{"_id":"68a736318ec3d8323af1ce45","nodeId":"FK59Zsm5ENA9g11XWCan_","roadmapSlug":"react","createdAt":"2025-08-21T15:07:28.899Z","description":"# useState Hook\n\n`useState` is a React Hook that lets you add state to functional components. When you call `useState`, you get back the current state value and a function to update it, allowing components to store and manage data that persists between renders.","resources":[{"type":"official","title":"useState Documentation","url":"https://react.dev/reference/react/useState","_id":"6a7f4f9dcb44947debd1c1be"},{"type":"official","title":"State: A Component's Memory","url":"https://react.dev/learn/state-a-components-memory","_id":"6a7f4f9dcb44947debd1c1bf"},{"type":"official","title":"Adding Interactivity","url":"https://react.dev/learn/adding-interactivity","_id":"6a7f4f9dcb44947debd1c1c0"},{"type":"article","title":"eact Hooks: useState Explained","url":"https://www.robinwieruch.de/react-usestate-hook/","_id":"6a7f4f9dcb44947debd1c1c1"}],"updatedAt":"2026-08-14T17:25:49.234Z","lessonPacks":[],"paidResources":[{"_id":"6a5e04dbfb5fcb94d04163ae","title":"Scrimba - Advanced React","partner":"Scrimba","type":"course","url":"https://v2.scrimba.com/advanced-react-c02h?via=roadmap"},{"_id":"6a5e04dbfb5fcb94d04163fe","title":"Scrimba - Build a Movie Search App in React","partner":"Scrimba","type":"course","url":"https://v2.scrimba.com/build-a-movie-search-app-in-react-c0u?via=roadmap"},{"_id":"6a5e04dbfb5fcb94d041644e","title":"Scrimba - Build Tic Tac Toe with React Hooks","partner":"Scrimba","type":"course","url":"https://v2.scrimba.com/build-tic-tac-toe-with-react-hooks-c0m?via=roadmap"}],"contribution":"https://github.com/kamranahmedse/developer-roadmap/tree/master/roadmaps/react/content/FK59Zsm5ENA9g11XWCan_.md"}